#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:305
#, c-format
msgid "source mask from %s unavailable: no glow"
msgstr "無法取得來自「%s」的光源遮罩：不產生輝光"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:308
msgid ""
"the source mask module is missing, disabled, after kazuki in the pipe, or has no drawn or parametric mask.\n"
"kazuki adds no glow until that is fixed or the source mask is set to none."
msgstr ""
"提供光源遮罩的模組不存在、已停用、在處理流程中位於 kazuki 之後，或沒有繪製或參數遮罩。\n"
"在修正此問題或將光源遮罩設為「無」之前，kazuki 不會產生輝光。"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:349
msgid "ekvido kazuki"
msgstr "ekvido kazuki"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:354
msgid "kazuki|glow|bloom|halation|star|glint|flare"
msgstr "kazuki|輝光|光暈|星芒|閃光|耀光|glow|bloom|halation|star|glint|flare"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:359
msgid "highlights glow in their own warm or cool colour, with halo, haze and star shapes"
msgstr "亮部依自身顏色和冷暖偏向發出對應顏色的輝光，形狀包括光暈、薄霧與星芒"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:360 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:101
msgid "creative"
msgstr "創意"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:360 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:101
msgid "linear, RGB"
msgstr "線性、RGB"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:360 src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:361
#: src/iop/ekvidomist.c:101 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:102
msgid "linear, RGB, scene-referred"
msgstr "線性、RGB、場景參照"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:462
msgid "inconsistent output"
msgstr "輸出結果不一致"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:513
msgid "ekvido kazuki: not enough memory, module skipped"
msgstr "ekvido kazuki：記憶體不足，已略過此模組"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:562
msgid "kazuki default"
msgstr "kazuki 預設"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:575
msgid "kazuki wide"
msgstr "kazuki 寬幅"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:673
msgid "cannot show a glow preview while a blend mask is displayed"
msgstr "顯示混合遮罩時無法預覽輝光"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:733
msgid "none"
msgstr "無"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:756
#, c-format
msgid "%s (unavailable)"
msgstr "%s（無法使用）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:806 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:356
msgid "glow shape on a log scale; the bar shows a fraction of the image diagonal"
msgstr "以對數尺度顯示輝光形狀；比例尺為影像對角線的比例"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:808
msgid "preview"
msgstr "預覽"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:809
msgid "what the centre view shows (not saved, not exported): the final image, the glow alone, the highlight energy, the warmth map (blue cool, grey neutral, orange warm) or the clipped areas in red"
msgstr "中央檢視顯示的內容（不會儲存，也不會匯出）：最終影像、僅輝光、亮部能量、冷暖分佈（藍為冷、灰為中性、橙為暖），或以紅色標出過曝區域"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:812
msgid "energy"
msgstr "能量"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:812
msgid "final"
msgstr "最終影像"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:812
msgid "glow only"
msgstr "僅輝光"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:813
msgid "clipped"
msgstr "過曝"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:813
msgid "warmth"
msgstr "冷暖"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:817
msgid "overall amount of glow added"
msgstr "加入輝光的整體強度"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:819
msgid "additive: glow adds light, like flare. conserve: light moves from sources to surroundings, total stays the same; screen / overlay / colour dodge / glow dodge: Clip Studio Paint's layer modes (overlay also darkens glow-free areas); overlay (glow only): overlay that leaves glow-free areas alone"
msgstr "相加：輝光線性增加光量，就像耀光。守恆：光從光源移到周圍，總光量不變；濾色／覆蓋／加亮顏色／加亮顏色（發光）：Clip Studio Paint 的圖層混合模式（覆蓋也會壓暗沒有輝光的區域）；覆蓋（僅輝光）：不影響沒有輝光的區域的覆蓋"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:825
msgid "for screen, the overlays and the dodges: the brightness treated as the layer's white; 0 = paper white"
msgstr "用於濾色、兩種覆蓋與兩種加亮顏色：視為圖層白色的亮度；0 = 紙白"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:830 src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:832
msgid "detection"
msgstr "偵測"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:832
msgid "source mask"
msgstr "光源遮罩"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:836
msgid "where light may come from: the drawn and/or parametric mask of a module before kazuki (e.g. an exposure instance at 0 EV). only masked areas emit; the glow still spreads over the whole image. kazuki's own blending mask still gates the output."
msgstr "光可以從哪裡發出：使用 kazuki 之前某個模組的繪製遮罩和／或參數遮罩（例如一個設為 0 EV 的曝光模組實例）。只有遮罩內的區域會發光，輝光仍會擴散到整張影像。kazuki 自己的混合遮罩仍會限制輸出範圍。"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:842
msgid "light comes from outside the source mask instead"
msgstr "改為從光源遮罩以外的區域發光"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:843
msgid "how bright a pixel must be to glow; 0 = paper white, each +1 doubles it"
msgstr "像素要多亮才會發光；0 = 紙白，每 +1 亮度加倍"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:844
msgid "fades glow in gradually around the threshold instead of a hard cut"
msgstr "在臨界值附近逐漸淡入輝光，而非硬性截斷"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:846
msgid "auto: find clipped highlights automatically; manual: use the clip level below"
msgstr "自動：自動找出過曝的亮部；手動：使用下方的過曝亮度定義"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:847
msgid "in manual mode, the brightness treated as clipped; 0 = paper white"
msgstr "手動模式下視為過曝的亮度；0 = 紙白"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:849
msgid "colour"
msgstr "色彩"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:850
msgid "how far around each bright spot its colour is read from; clipped spots take their fringe's colour"
msgstr "從每個亮點周圍多遠的範圍取色；過曝的亮點採用其邊緣的顏色"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:851
msgid "shifts what counts as neutral; move it if neutral sources glow orange or blue"
msgstr "移動「中性」的定義基準；若目標中性光源在場景中發出橙色或藍色的輝光可以此調整"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:852
msgid "how gradually glows change from cool to warm; higher gives more in-between tones"
msgstr "輝光由冷轉暖的漸變程度；越高中間色調越多"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:853
msgid "warmth for blown-out spots with no colour around them: 1 warm, 0 cool"
msgstr "周圍沒有顏色的過曝亮點的冷暖：1 為暖，0 為冷"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:854
msgid "how strongly warm glows take the warm colours; 0 keeps the source's own colour"
msgstr "暖色輝光套用暖色的強度；0 保留光源本身的顏色"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:855
msgid "how strongly cool glows take the cool colours; 0 keeps the source's own colour"
msgstr "冷色輝光套用冷色的強度；0 保留光源本身的顏色"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:856 src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:857
msgid "colour at the centre of warm glows (pale gold)"
msgstr "暖色輝光中心的顏色（淡金色）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:858 src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:859
msgid "colour at the outside of warm glows (orange)"
msgstr "暖色輝光外圍的顏色（橙色）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:860 src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:861
msgid "colour at the centre of cool glows (cyan)"
msgstr "冷色輝光中心的顏色（青色）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:862 src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:863
msgid "colour at the outside of cool glows (deep blue)"
msgstr "冷色輝光外圍的顏色（深藍色）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:864
msgid "where the centre colour hands over to the edge colour"
msgstr "中心色過渡到邊緣色的位置"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:866 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:368
msgid "halo"
msgstr "光暈"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:867 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:369
msgid "size of the main soft glow (fraction of the image diagonal)"
msgstr "主要柔和輝光的大小（影像對角線的比例）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:868 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:370
msgid "low: long misty tail; high: tight glow"
msgstr "低：拖出長長的霧狀尾巴；高：輝光集中"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:869 src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:870
msgid "stretch the halo into an oval"
msgstr "將光暈拉成橢圓狀"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:871 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:373
msgid "share of the glow in the halo (black mist: high)"
msgstr "光暈在輝光中的佔比（黑柔焦：高）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:873 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:375
msgid "haze"
msgstr "薄霧"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:874
msgid "size of the very wide, faint haze"
msgstr "範圍極廣、極淡的薄霧大小"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:875 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:377
msgid "low: haze reaches further"
msgstr "低：薄霧延伸得更遠"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:876 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:378
msgid "share of the glow in the wide haze (white mist: high)"
msgstr "廣域薄霧在輝光中的佔比（白柔焦：高）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:878 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:380
msgid "star"
msgstr "星芒"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:879 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:381
msgid "number of arms; 4 = cross, 2 = horizontal streak, 0 = off"
msgstr "光芒數；4 = 十字，2 = 水平光條，0 = 關閉"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:880
msgid "angle of the first arm (degrees)"
msgstr "第一道光芒的角度（度）"

#: src/iop/ekvidokazuki.c:882 src/iop/ekvidomist.c:384
